    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5759" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιδαίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kindle around:</i>—only intr. in pf.
			and plpf., <i>burn, blaze around,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϋτή τε πτόλεμός τε ἄστυ τόδ᾽
					ἀμφιδέδηε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.329
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ μάχη τ᾽ ἐνοπή τε δεδήει τεῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.35
				</span></i>
			; of dust, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνις σφ᾽ ἀμφιδεδήει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			.</div>
